es to convert  solar energy to other types of energy  engineers have already developed a huge  variety of ways to generate electricity  and you can expect more in the future  what is important to remember is that  the results of these efforts is the same  as far as the electricity is concerned  they create a flow of electrical current  that then has to be distributed to the  people that need to use it  but how does the electrical energy get  from generators to my house  in the next lesson we'll learn about the  electric grid its origins and how the  new smart grid will carry us into the  future
 

